<Box style={{width: 1280, height: 720, background: "#FAFAF7", padding: "28px 64px 24px", flexDirection: "column", fontFamily: "PingFang SC"}}><Box style={{height: 96, flexDirection: "column", justifyContent: "center"}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.40)", letterSpacing: 1}}>第四幕 · 你写哪类程序</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 36, fontWeight: 600, color: "#1C1F23", lineHeight: 1.25, marginTop: 10}}>模型看到什么，就被记下什么</Text></Box><Box style={{height: 532, flexDirection: "column", justifyContent: "center"}}><Box style={{flexDirection: "row", gap: 44, alignItems: "center", justifyContent: "center"}}><Box style={{width: 320, height: 140, background: "rgba(28,31,35,0.05)", borderRadius: 10, justifyContent: "center", alignItems: "center", borderLeft: "4px solid #1C1F23"}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 20, color: "#1C1F23"}}>会话：类型化 · 只追加</Text></Box><Box style={{flexDirection: "column", gap: 10, justifyContent: "center"}}><Box style={{flexDirection: "row", alignItems: "center", gap: 12, padding: "12px 18px", background: "rgba(15,110,86,0.07)", borderRadius: 8}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 19, color: "#0F6E56"}}>↳</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 21, color: "#1C1F23"}}>回放</Text></Box><Box style={{flexDirection: "row", alignItems: "center", gap: 12, padding: "12px 18px", background: "rgba(15,110,86,0.07)", borderRadius: 8}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 19, color: "#0F6E56"}}>↳</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 21, color: "#1C1F23"}}>恢复</Text></Box><Box style={{flexDirection: "row", alignItems: "center", gap: 12, padding: "12px 18px", background: "rgba(15,110,86,0.07)", borderRadius: 8}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 19, color: "#0F6E56"}}>↳</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 21, color: "#1C1F23"}}>分叉</Text></Box><Box style={{flexDirection: "row", alignItems: "center", gap: 12, padding: "12px 18px", background: "rgba(15,110,86,0.07)", borderRadius: 8}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 19, color: "#0F6E56"}}>↳</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 21, color: "#1C1F23"}}>审计</Text></Box></Box></Box><Box style={{flexDirection: "column", justifyContent: "center", alignItems: "center", marginTop: 38}}><Text style={{fontSize: 26, fontWeight: 600, color: "#1C1F23", lineHeight: 1.5, textAlign: "center"}}>single source of truth —— 回放 / 恢复 / 分叉 / 审计，用的是同一份日志，只是四种看法。</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 20, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.70)", lineHeight: 1.6, marginTop: 14, textAlign: "center"}}>对照 P16（看清）：那里要求「每一步都留下痕迹」，这里是「留下来的就是唯一的依据」。</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 23, fontWeight: 600, color: "#0F6E56", lineHeight: 1.5, marginTop: 16, textAlign: "center"}}>落点：审计不是事后附加，是架构级属性。</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{height: 40, flexDirection: "row", justifyContent: "space-between", alignItems: "flex-end"}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.35)"}}>AI CODING EVOLUTION</Text><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.45)"}}>31 / 36</Text></Box></Box>
